   1                       *2763
   2 002763  7300  D02763, CLA CLL
   3 002764  3776  L02764, DCA I P02776    / Clear a word, starting at 3000
   4 002765  1363          TAD D02763      / Reached ourself?
   5 002766  2376          ISZ P02776      / Bump pointer
   6 002767  7640          SZA CLA 
   7 002770  5364  D02770, JMP L02764      / No, keep going
   8 002771  1376          TAD P02776      / Yes, get pointer
   9 002772  3000  D02772, DCA 0           / Store at zero
  10 002773  3376          DCA P02776      / Clear a couple of words
  11 002774  3370          DCA D02770      / So we can fall through
  12 002775  3372          DCA D02772      / without mangling 0 or DCA I 0
  13 002776  3000  P02776, 03000           / Where to clear next.
  14 002777  3400          DCA I 0         / Clear a word, fall through again
  15               $

